OL,3,AAustralian MP's condition improves
OL,4,Aafter alleged car attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe condition of Helen Haines, the
OL,7,FAustralian MP hit by a car five days
OL,8,Fago in north-east Victoria, has
OL,9,Fimproved from critical to serious but
OL,10,Fstable.
OL,12,FThe independent MP, 65, had both her
OL,13,Flegs amputated after what authorities
OL,14,Fsay was a deliberate attack outside her
OL,15,Felectorate office in Wangaratta,
OL,16,Fnorth-east of Melbourne, on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
