OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAustralian MP's condition improves
OL,4,Aafter alleged car attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the latest update on Saturday
OL,7,Fmorning, the Alfred Hospital in
OL,8,FMelbourne said Haines was in a serious
OL,9,Fbut stable condition, the first
OL,10,Fimprovement since she was airlifted
OL,11,Fthere.
OL,13,FHer alleged attacker, 43-year-old
OL,14,FBrendan Nugent, was arrested shortly
OL,15,Fafter the incident and has since
OL,16,Fappeared in court on three charges.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
